PKStack is an independent Kiro-native implementation of portable
verified-development workflow ideas. It does not ship the Kiro or Cursor
runtimes. Third-party attribution, including the upstream pstack and direct
runtime dependency notices, is recorded in
[`powers/pkstack/THIRD_PARTY_NOTICES.md`](powers/pkstack/THIRD_PARTY_NOTICES.md).

The generated mascot is disclosed in the Power asset documentation. The
private Floci integration lab is a separate repository and is not part of this
release.
